# Per-attempt raw outputs are large / transient. Only metadata /
# summary / verdict files are committed by default.
#
# Both the `attempt_*` result trees and the `infracheck_*` result trees
# follow the same layout: verdict.md / verdict.json / summary.md /
# metadata.json at the top, everything else under `raw/`. The globs
# below keep every `raw/` subtree and every top-level log / jsonl file
# untracked; the small text files above stay committed as attempt
# evidence.
attempt_*/raw/
attempt_*/logs/
attempt_*/*.log
attempt_*/*.jsonl
infracheck_*/raw/
infracheck_*/logs/
infracheck_*/*.log
infracheck_*/*.jsonl
